    question: "<small class='instruction-note'>日本文に合うように、次の語句を並び替えなさい。</small><br><small>約束したことは果たさなければならない。</small><br>You must ( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ).",
    words: ["have", "carry", "you", "what", "promised", "out"],
